  "stories": [
    { "id": "S1", "kind": "data-flow", "text": "agents accounts usage reads Claude and Codex usage of each account from stand-in providers and never refreshes a token. Variations: V1 expired token (failure: the account shows 'login needed', the token file is unchanged); V2 an answer of another shape than the current endpoint's (Claude limits[], Codex rate_limit) (failure: the error with the field, no zero usage); V3 Codex rate-limit headers only (failure: no rate_limit).", "objectives": ["O1"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/agents.rs::account_usage_comes_from_each_provider_read_only_and_a_changed_answer_is_an_error"] },
    { "id": "S2", "kind": "control-flow", "text": "An operator member starts under its account; a Claude team-mode teammate with an account is refused; at the configured limit a session resumes under the next account with its transcript. Variations: V1 no next account (failure: the member stops with the limit reason); V2 limit reached during a tool call (success: the switch waits for the turn end); V3 the usage of its account cannot be read (failure: the wake fails with the reason, no run on the account).", "objectives": ["O2"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/threads.rs::a_member_runs_under_its_account_and_resumes_under_the_next_at_its_limit", "test:crates/legionctl/tests/threads.rs::a_wake_fails_when_its_account_usage_cannot_be_read"] },
    { "id": "S3", "text": "The member chips show the account with 5 h and 7 d usage; the picker sets an operator member's account in the thread (`thread.account`, with its approval) and the chat bar's account. Variations: V1 pick for a teammate (failure: no picker, the chip says why, the operation refuses it).", "objectives": ["O3"],
      "tests": ["test:crates/legionctl/tests/app.rs::the_member_chip_shows_its_account_usage_and_the_picker_sets_it"] }
  ],
